# Play test of Gullsong Bazaar (CIPlay gullsong_bazaar, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The lagoon round 0 10 (2.5 m deep), the boardwalk from the landing (0 28) south to z -2 (x -0.75..0.75, deck 1 m), the
# stall pontoons: the net-maker (-3.75..-0.75 18..21), the spice-seller (0.75..3.75 14..17), the potter (-3.75..-0.75 9..12),
# the lamp-maker (0.75..3.75 5..8), the merchant's (-3..3 -2.5..2); the shell crate on the south bank (-11 -7.6).
island Gullsong Bazaar
offset 0.0248 -0.7349
expect step 0
expect title A Fair Trade
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
walk 0 36 to 0 31 to 0 27.5 h=1
zone bazaar
expect step 0
read Notice of the closing bazaar
expect step 1
use spicestall
expect message SPICE-SELLER
open Shell crate
expect story shell 1
expect step 2
use netstall
expect story rope 1
expect step 3
use spicestall
expect story pepper 1
expect step 3
use potstall
expect story jar 1
expect step 3
use lampstall
expect story lamp 1
expect step 4
use merchantstall
expect story merchantkey 1
expect step 5
open Merchant's strongbox
expect done
open Fish stall's box
open Pontoon barrel
